{{page-title "About Us — Riyasri Silks"}}

<div class="page-header page-header--about">
  <div class="page-header-content">
    <span class="page-eyebrow">Our Story</span>
    <h1>About Riyasri Silks</h1>
    <p>Where tradition meets timeless elegance</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page-content">
  <div class="about-container">
    <section class="about-section about-section--hero">
      <div class="about-text">
        <h2>Crafted with Passion</h2>
        <p>Riyasri Silks was born from a desire to blend the timeless beauty of Indian sarees with the precision of modern digital craft. Every piece in our collection tells a story of heritage, artistry, and the skilled hands that bring them to life.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="about-visual">
        <div class="about-visual-circle"></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section about-section--alternating">
      <div class="about-block">
        <div class="about-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" width="40" height="40" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round">
            <rect x="6" y="6" width="36" height="36" rx="4"/>
            <line x1="6" y1="18" x2="42" y2="18"/>
            <line x1="18" y1="6" x2="18" y2="42"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="about-block-text">
          <h3>Powerloom Sarees</h3>
          <p>Our powerloom collection offers precision-woven sarees that combine efficiency with elegance. Made using advanced mechanical looms, these sarees deliver consistent quality, vibrant patterns, and affordability — making traditional beauty accessible to everyone.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="about-block about-block--reverse">
        <div class="about-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" width="40" height="40" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round">
            <path d="M8 40 C8 20, 24 8, 24 8 C24 8, 40 20, 40 40"/>
            <line x1="14" y1="30" x2="34" y2="30"/>
            <circle cx="24" cy="18" r="4"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="about-block-text">
          <h3>Handloom Sarees</h3>
          <p>Each handloom saree in our collection is a testament to generations of weaving mastery. Crafted entirely by hand on traditional looms, these sarees carry the soul of the artisan — every thread, every motif placed with intention and care passed down through centuries.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="about-block">
        <div class="about-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" width="40" height="40" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round">
            <polygon points="24,4 44,16 44,36 24,44 4,36 4,16"/>
            <line x1="24" y1="4" x2="24" y2="44"/>
            <line x1="4" y1="16" x2="44" y2="16"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="about-block-text">
          <h3>Types of Sarees Available</h3>
          <p>From Banarasi silks to cotton daily wear, from designer party sarees to bridal masterpieces — our curated collections span every occasion, fabric, and region. Whether you seek Kanjeevaram grandeur, Chanderi grace, or contemporary fusion designs, you'll find it here.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="about-block about-block--reverse">
        <div class="about-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" width="40" height="40" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round">
            <circle cx="24" cy="24" r="18"/>
            <path d="M16 24 L22 30 L34 18"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="about-block-text">
          <h3>Affordable Pricing</h3>
          <p>We believe every woman deserves to own a beautiful saree without compromise. By working directly with weavers and eliminating middlemen, we bring you the finest quality at the most honest prices. Luxury should be accessible — that's our promise.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

